 R←Test_ListFiles2_003(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;list;list2;parms
⍝ Test the `ListFiles2` method with depth←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 parms←⎕NS''
 parms.recurse←2
 list←parms ##.FilesAndDirs.ListFiles2 ∆Home
 →T.PassesIf 0<≢list

 parms.depth←1
 list2←parms ##.FilesAndDirs.ListFiles2 ∆Home
 →T.PassesIf 0<≢list2
 →T.PassesIf</≢¨list2 list
 (list list2)←(1+≢∆Home)↓¨¨list list2
 →T.PassesIf list2 APLTreeUtils2.LazyMatch(1={+/⍵∊'/\'}¨list)/list

 R←T._OK
